    "title": "Noj - a simple data analysis stack in Clojure",
    "section": "",
    "text": "Noj is an out-of-the-box Clojure library designed to streamline data science workflows for both newcomers and experienced users. Noj provides a tested and integrated collection of libraries that are known to work seamlessly together from day one, rather than requiring users to find, configure, and integrate multiple libraries separately."
